WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:02.429
Speaker 1: . Big, big news.

00:00:02.429 --> 00:00:10.400
Joe Biden yesterday came out in full support
of lifting patent protections on coronavirus

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.880
vaccines to help produce more vaccines globally.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:21.890
The Biden administration said that we need
a breakthrough for international vaccination.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:27.050
Vaccination happening quite well in the United
States and well in a few other countries.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:31.390
But there are lots of countries that don't
even have vaccines on the immediate horizon

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:33.220
right now.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:41.600
And Joe Biden has now said, let's do it, let's
suspend intellectual property protections

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.899
to ramp up vaccine production.

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:46.399
And this is something Joe Biden has been increasing.

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:53.100
Lee, under pressure to say it's not doesn't
appear to be something Joe Biden can actually

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.909
do, but the reasoning is clear.

00:00:56.909 --> 00:00:58.930
We have a global health crisis.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.359
These are extraordinary circumstances.

00:01:01.359 --> 00:01:04.869
We need to produce as many doses as quickly
as possible.

00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:10.610
And this would be a case where while you can
respect conceptually intellectual property

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:16.310
protections and patents and copyright, you
can make the case this particular situation

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.610
warrants lifting those protections.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:22.340
Now, I have to tell you, for me, there are
two stories here.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:24.220
First of all.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:31.280
Is the story that Joe Biden is being pushed
left, I mean, at this point on paper, this

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.420
may be the most progressive administration
in history.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:39.250
I, I we have to understand what we're comparing
to.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.899
But this is something that Big Pharma was
completely against.

00:01:42.899 --> 00:01:48.619
They got expensive lobbyists pushing for it
not to be done, for there to be no lifting

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:50.539
of patents.

00:01:50.539 --> 00:01:55.520
And while Joe Biden can't actually do it,
Biden standing up to them and saying this

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.350
should be done is a really big deal.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:02.509
If you look at Joe Biden's position on health
care, it's to the left of Obama.

00:02:02.509 --> 00:02:06.320
If you look at Joe Biden's position on taxation,
it's to the left of Obama.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.900
On paper, this may be the most progressive
administration in history.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:15.240
Now, we've never had you know, Bernie has
never been president.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.230
So we have to understand what that means.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:22.570
For those who said Joe Biden could not be
pushed left, he clearly has been, at least

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:23.570
to some degree.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:27.230
Now, here's my concern about this entire vaccine
thing, that vaccine patent thing.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:31.300
I agree that the patents should be lifted.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:35.580
I agree that as many places as possible should
be given whatever they need to start manufacturing

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.720
vaccines as quickly as possible.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.670
There's no question whatsoever.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.230
That being said.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:48.370
I don't think the lifting of patents is actually
going to get us out of this mess, why?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:54.170
In researching what it would take for places
that are not yet producing vaccines to start

00:02:54.170 --> 00:03:01.640
producing vaccines, you could be looking at
two years of time to build the infrastructure

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.740
to produce vaccines if you start today.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:10.820
So while I agree that the patents should be
lifted and there are reasons for the future,

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:14.140
that it would be great to set that precedent
in a global pandemic and all.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.140
I'm with it.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:16.140
I'm with you.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.490
I think this is a great thing that Joe Biden
has said.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:23.370
If it takes two years to build the infrastructure,
if you don't have it to start producing vaccines,

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:27.360
if you start today and who could start today,
you've got to find locations.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:33.610
You have to figure out where are these factories
going to go if it takes four months to start

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:38.540
and then it takes two years to do and then
the entire vaccine production and distribution

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.700
would take several more months.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.790
We are looking at new vaccine production.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.880
If patents are lifted today, that wouldn't
deliver vaccines until the end of twenty,

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:48.880
twenty three.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:49.880
It's just too late.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:50.880
I don't want to be a party pooper.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.100
I don't want to rain on anybody's parade.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:04:01.080
But it's not clear to me that this is anything
more than at least for the next two years,

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.050
a theoretical or academic question.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.530
It should be done.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.110
And for the future pandemic.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.110
I'm with it again.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.110
I'm with it.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.110
I'm with it.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.440
Please, please don't write to me saying, David,
how dare you be against it?

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.870
No, I'm for it.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:16.010
But when I see all these people on Facebook
saying we could just get out of this if the

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:19.950
vaccine patents were lifted, Moderna did say
it won't enforce its patent.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:24.570
There's other aspects of the production that
Moderna doesn't control which have intellectual

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.570
property protections.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.860
I get that.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.090
I just don't see how this gets us out of the
pandemic any sooner.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.850
If I'm missing something, let me know the
right decision.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:39.230
I don't actually think it will get vaccines
into people's arms any sooner for this pandemic.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.230
Let me know your thoughts.

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.660
I'm on Twitter at David Pakman.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:42.770
Quick break.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:43.210
Great show today

